# ============================================================
# Man'yōshū Garden Map — environment variables
# ============================================================
#
# This project currently requires NO runtime environment variables.
# Everything is static: content lives in src/data/*.ts, images live in
# src/assets/, and there is no database or authentication.
#
# This file exists so that (a) future integrations have a documented
# home, and (b) hosting providers that expect an .env.example file
# have one to detect.
#
# Rules:
#   * Never commit real secrets. Real values go into your host's
#     environment (Vercel/Netlify/Cloudflare dashboards) or a local
#     .env file that is gitignored.
#   * VITE_-prefixed variables are exposed to the browser bundle.
#     Never put secrets behind a VITE_ prefix.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Reserved placeholders (uncomment and fill only if you add these
# features later; NONE are needed for the current app):
# ------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Analytics (e.g. Plausible / Umami / GA4). Safe to expose.
# VITE_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN=
#
# If you migrate content to Supabase later:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=   # server-only, NEVER expose
#
# If you add a contact form email relay:
# RESEND_API_KEY=              # server-only
